WAxW6i68BHTjHL8cQ3YcHCG0oAA"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwi9_MWzwdKWAxW6i68BHTjHL8cQ3IcHCGwoCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_TIPS"],"分享停車相關資訊",null,null,"請提供停車場地點和停車位數量等資訊","停車場",null,"0ahUKEwi9_MWzwdKWAxW6i68BHTjHL8cQ3IcHCG4oDA",null,null,["最近的停車位就是林森公園地下停車場。停好車從南京東路出口出來。"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_MWzwdKWAxW6i68BHTjHL8cQ3YcHCHAoAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_MWzwdKWAxW6i68BHTjHL8cQ3IcHCG8oDQ",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["一大棟兩三樓層用餐環境，對比一般常見拉麵店用餐環境，這裡確實頗舒適。有著大片落地窗、木質色系裝潢，整體乾淨度、開放空間、內外對比，相對獨特。餐點只有兩種，雞湯拉麵跟沾麵，價格尚親民，但是飽足感似乎不太夠。湯頭味道都濃郁，但至少不是油膩厚重。一碗湯中雞肉混豬肉是比較少見做法，都不難吃，店家似乎沒有提供個人偏好的軟嫩叉燒。沾麵的粗麵體口感相當好，彈牙不硬。加入一整顆溏心蛋也較少見，但看得出店家的誠意。外場服務生似乎不太夠，一人分飾多角……",null,[0,219]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlUzFxWmtkbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlUzFxWmtkbkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlUzFxWmtkbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlUzFxWmtkbkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlUzFxWmtkbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlUzFxWmtkbkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,27933,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3eS1qZkdnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xc45a4fb872906ad6!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID7y-jfGg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/cont